  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/514",
  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-59ba1f18-c17b-4495-b4bd-d2ba78f557b8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4652da57-162f-4199-a50f-2b8051b858d7\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">지난 주 제주도에서 열린 생물학회에 다녀왔습니다. (학회는 난생 처음)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-f6ca66f8-6082-4dc3-a8ec-a72043245857\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ffc24333-b1c4-4511-99bc-1d06c4aee78d\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">국립생태원, 국립낙동강생물자원관 등에서 부스를 차리고 홍보활동을 하고 있었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-76235688-7392-498f-9711-faa25b2d22b2\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-20ea155d-c9ba-48d4-ad0d-1111c7963106\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-1b125b1f-3adc-4e78-8602-6c722079a6d9\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c944007a-bf24-4ed8-8460-db7ed140ac67\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">그 중 국립생태원에서 홍보하고 있는 에코뱅크가 뭔가 싶어, 부스에 서서  잠깐 설명을 들었는데요.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-e6400629-ad67-4984-9e79-8ba1085f9245\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-403ad629-6df9-46cc-b38b-064193d53789\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-f0e4c73a-74a0-4658-b674-9027f2bca7b3\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8614fb0d-148e-4842-8178-9288c9d77906\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">생태정보를 모아모아서 데이터를 정리하고 사용할 수 있게 해주는 허브 역할을 하는 곳.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-1642df13-c58f-4b48-a38b-47da46b01910\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-c8605ac2-1a63-43ad-b7f3-8d54cb69a022\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">우리나라 지도에 생물종 분포가 표시도 됩니다. (아직 미완, 12월되어야 정상궤도에 올라간다고 합니다.)</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-cb9502f0-0b0c-4287-8c27-06120123d0cb\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f9a6ee0a-084a-43a1-a87e-b2d8d9c0ee15\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-399aac7d-fe1c-48fe-978b-0822507f8189\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-49c6a3a1-4b73-4946-8a2b-94f50964e8e4\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">시간순이나 공간적 순서에 따른 데이터를  활용해서 '데이터기반 탐구활동 수업'을 디자인해볼 수 있지 않을까?라는 생각이 들긴 했는데..</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-831e957d-3808-4fcb-ae68-62305abe3f20\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-019f9d2a-db8d-4e54-ad9c-797fe4b023be\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-26135683-196e-414c-ad07-95f72eabe260\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9907ea1b-81ed-4218-bf35-9b13d868a3ec\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">막막해서 일단 스톱. 당장 써먹을 데도 없으니..</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-05c2b776-53a3-4cf4-81e5-c4b16bee6ad5\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f957a418-82ca-43b2-8e6b-a75d9fff2d1f\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">&#8203;</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b2617939-8cdf-471f-8a14-67c2c4c694f8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-22ee9681-e33f-4dd3-b824-99265c8d22d9\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">그래도, 이 사이트 매력적이라 어딘가 &amp; 언젠가 꼭 활용해보려고 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b2617939-8cdf-471f-8a14-67c2c4c694f8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 0px; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b2617939-8cdf-471f-8a14-67c2c4c694f8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">선생님들께서도 한 번 둘러보세요~</span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b2617939-8cdf-471f-8a14-67c2c4c694f8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" id=\"SE-b2617939-8cdf-471f-8a14-67c2c4c694f8\" style=\"border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 1.8; font-family: se-nanumgothic, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\"><a href=\"http://ecobank.nie.re.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">http://ecobank.nie.re.kr/</a><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
